-- CA_0176_la_city_by_district_batch_d3_2026.sql
-- LA-cities slice, by-district batch D3: Arcadia, Montebello, South Pasadena, Azusa, Duarte. All five elect their
-- council BY DISTRICT but were modeled at large; each gets one LOCAL district row + X0001 polygon per council district
-- (LA RR/CC precinct layer, Political_Boundaries/MapServer/34, DST_CITY/DIV_CITY, dissolved; read 2026-09-23; QA:
-- district union vs TIGER place IoU Arcadia 0.9964, Montebello 0.9968, South Pasadena 0.9955, Azusa 0.9931, Duarte
-- 0.9919 -- the CA_0141/CA_0167/CA_0172/CA_0173 method), and each sitting member's EXISTING office moves onto their
-- district (term history moves with it). District assignment = each city's own council page, read 2026-09-22/23.
-- All five have council-chosen mayors: the member the 2025 roster import put in a separate "Mayor" office is simply
-- that district's member (Cao D5, Braun D5, Gonzales D5, Garcia D6). Montebello's empty "Mayor" row keeps no office.
--
-- ROSTER CHANGES since the 2025 CA Roster import (each from the city's own record):
--   Arcadia D3     Eileen Wang resigned 2026-05-11 -> John Han appointed 2026-06-16 (takes the same office)
--   Montebello D4  David Torres resigned 2025-01-28 -> Danielle Romero appointed 2025-02-26
--   Montebello D5  Angie Jimenez recalled, removed 2024-12-05 -> Ricardo "Ric" Alonzo appointed 2025-01-29
-- NEW POLITICIAN ROWS (the three appointees above take the moved office; the others, left out by the import, get a
-- new seat cloned from the city's council office):
--   Arcadia        D2  Sharon Kwan            https://www.arcadiaca.gov/government/city_council/index.php
--   Arcadia        D3  John Han               https://www.arcadiaca.gov/government/city_council/vacant.php
--   Montebello     D4  Danielle Romero        https://www.montebelloca.gov/government/elected_officials/councilmember_romero
--   Montebello     D5  Ricardo Alonzo         https://www.montebelloca.gov/government/elected_officials/councilmember_alonzo
--   South Pasadena D2  Sheila Rossi           https://www.southpasadenaca.gov/Your-Government/Your-City-Council
--   South Pasadena D3  Jon Primuth            https://www.southpasadenaca.gov/Your-Government/Your-City-Council
--   Azusa          AL  Edward J. Alvarez      https://www.azusaca.gov/72/City-Council-Members
--   Duarte         D1  Margaret E. Finlay     https://www.cityofduarte.ca.gov/government/mayor-city-council
--   Duarte         D2  Martin Calderon        https://www.cityofduarte.ca.gov/government/mayor-city-council
--   Duarte         D3  Vinh Truong            https://www.cityofduarte.ca.gov/government/mayor-city-council
--   Duarte         D4  Tera Martin Del Campo  https://www.cityofduarte.ca.gov/government/mayor-city-council
--   Duarte         D5  Samuel Kang            https://www.cityofduarte.ca.gov/government/mayor-city-council
--   Duarte         D7  Toney Lewis            https://www.cityofduarte.ca.gov/government/mayor-city-council
--
-- AZUSA IS MID-TRANSITION (CA_0152 pattern): Mendez and Alvarez were elected AT LARGE in 2022 and keep "Council
-- Member (At-Large)" on the place row until December 2026. Districts 1 and 3 are elected for the first time in
-- Nov 2026 (city election page: "no eligible incumbents for City Council Districts 1 and 3 due to Districting"):
-- new offices flagged is_vacant carry those races. Mendez (D1) and Alvarez (D3) run as sitting officials, linked,
-- not seat incumbents.
--
-- MONTEBELLO CLERK / TREASURER: both elected; neither office existed. Created on the LOCAL_EXEC place row (Carson
-- pattern): City Clerk Christopher Jimenez (term to 2028, not up) and City Treasurer David Matanga (on this ballot).
-- NAME FIXES: "Dr. Michael Cao" -> Michael Cao (old form kept in alternate_names); "Janet Braun (District 5)" -> Janet Braun.
--
-- CONTESTS (each clerk's list, verified name by name and district by district against the original):
--   Arcadia City Council District 2                                   2 candidate(s)  1 incumbent(s)
--   Arcadia City Council District 3                                   3 candidate(s)  1 incumbent(s)
--   Arcadia City Council District 5                                   2 candidate(s)  1 incumbent(s)
--   Montebello City Council District 1                                4 candidate(s)  1 incumbent(s)
--   Montebello City Council District 3                                3 candidate(s)  0 incumbent(s)
--   Montebello City Council District 4 (Unexpired Term Ending 2028)   2 candidate(s)  1 incumbent(s)
--   Montebello City Council District 5                                2 candidate(s)  1 incumbent(s)
--   Montebello City Treasurer                                         1 candidate(s)  1 incumbent(s)  (uncontested)
--   South Pasadena City Council District 4                            2 candidate(s)  1 incumbent(s)
--   Azusa City Council District 1                                     3 candidate(s)  0 incumbent(s)
--   Azusa City Council District 3                                     2 candidate(s)  0 incumbent(s)
--   Duarte City Council District 1                                    2 candidate(s)  1 incumbent(s)
-- Montebello City Treasurer: one candidate; no EC 10229 appointment found in the Aug 26 / Sep 9 / Sep 23 2026
-- agendas, so it stays on the ballot. NOT ON THE BALLOT (appointed in lieu, EC 10229): South Pasadena D5 + City
-- Treasurer (Resolution No. 8024, 2026-08-19); Azusa City Clerk + City Treasurer (Resolution No. 2026-C48,
-- 2026-08-17); Duarte D4, D5, D6 (one qualified candidate each; the 2026-09-16 Notice of Nominees lists District 1 only).
--
-- RACES go on '2026 LA County General' (d91a20ce-557e-4615-a31b-5b2b3df2ed14); primary_party NULL; no party stored.
-- IDEMPOTENT: fixed ids for every new row; office moves guarded on the target; every insert NOT EXISTS-guarded.

